{"id":"ficelle","lemma":"ficelle","pos":"noun","rank":4759,"glosses":["twine","a very narrow baguette"],"ipa":"/fi.sɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e9/Fr-ficelle.ogg/Fr-ficelle.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ficelles"},"examples":[{"text":"Je connais les ficelles.","en":"I know the ropes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Je sais qui tire les ficelles.","en":"I know who's pulling the strings.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Il m'a appris les ficelles.","en":"He showed me the ropes.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to learn","l":"apprendre"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Il attacha le paquet avec une ficelle.","en":"He bound the package with a string.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to affix","l":"attacher"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"packet"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je te montrerai les ficelles du métier.","en":"I'll show you the ropes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to show","l":"montrer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"job, profession, trade"}]}]}